    "en": {
      "trackName": "Battle Run: Castle",
      "description": "Battle Run is set in a medieval fantasy world where you control a small group of elite troops, as they embark on a perilous journey to reclaim a besieged castle. The castle is held by a powerful enemy force, and your goal is to lead your troops through a series of increasingly challenging battles to liberate it.\n\nFeatures: \n- Endless levels\n- Play offline\n- Retro-style graphics\n- Available for watch and mobile devices",
      "releaseNotes": "- Bugfixes\n- More content added",
